lass="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/acre">Acre</a> to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/brazil">Brazil</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1932</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/chaco-war">Chaco War</a> with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/paraguay">Paraguay</a> begins</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1952</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bolivian-national-revolution">National Revolution</a> brings universal suffrage and nationalises the mines</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">2006</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/evo-morales">Evo Morales</a> becomes <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bolivia">Bolivia</a>’s first indigenous president</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">2009</span><span class="rf-text">A new constitution creates the Plurinational State of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bolivia">Bolivia</a></span></li></ol>
